WEBVTT

00:00:06.066 --> 00:00:07.851
Fred and George:
WOW! WE'RE IDENTICAL!

00:00:07.894 --> 00:00:09.287
Mad-Eye:
NOT YET, YOU'RE NOT.

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:15.641
George: YOU HAVEN'T
GOT ANYTHING A BIT MORE
SPORTING, HAVE YOU?

00:00:15.684 --> 00:00:17.425
Fred: YEAH, I DON'T REALLY
FANCY THIS COLOR.

00:00:17.469 --> 00:00:19.036
Mad-Eye: WELL, FANCY THIS.
YOU'RE NOT YOU.

00:00:19.079 --> 00:00:20.472
SO SHUT IT AND STRIP.

00:00:20.515 --> 00:00:22.126
Mundungus:
ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT.

00:00:22.169 --> 00:00:23.649
YOU'LL NEED TO CHANGE,
TOO, POTTER.

00:00:23.692 --> 00:00:26.826
Fleur: BILL, LOOK AWAY.
I'M HIDEOUS.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.089
Ron: I KNEW SHE WAS LYING
ABOUT THAT TATTOO.

00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:32.005
Hermione: HARRY?
YOUR EYESIGHT REALLY IS AWFUL.

00:00:32.049 --> 00:00:33.920
RIGHT, THEN.
WE'LL BE PAIRING OFF.

00:00:33.964 --> 00:00:35.879
EACH POTTER
WILL HAVE A PROTECTOR.

00:00:35.922 --> 00:00:39.186
MUNDUNGUS, STICK TIGHT TO ME.
I WANT TO KEEP AN EYE ON YOU.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:40.753
AS FOR HARRY...

00:00:40.796 --> 00:00:42.320
YES?YES?
YES?YES?

00:00:42.363 --> 00:00:43.799
THE REALHARRY.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.627
WHERE THE DEVIL ARE YOU,
ANYWAY?

00:00:45.671 --> 00:00:46.890
Harry:
[ SIGHS ] HERE.

00:00:46.933 --> 00:00:48.543
Mad-Eye:
YOU'LL RIDE WITH HAGRID.

00:00:48.587 --> 00:00:50.589
I BROUGHT YOU HERE
16 YEARS AGO

00:00:50.632 --> 00:00:53.113
WHEN YOU WERE NO BIGGER
THAN A BOWTRUCKLE.

00:00:53.157 --> 00:00:55.681
SEEMS ONLY RIGHT
THAT ISHOULD BE THE ONE

00:00:55.724 --> 00:00:57.117
TO TAKE YOU AWAY NOW.

00:00:57.161 --> 00:00:59.815
YES, IT'S ALL VERY TOUCHING.
LET'S GO!

00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:04.124
[ HEDWIG CHIRPING ]

00:01:07.954 --> 00:01:10.000
[ CHIRPING CONTINUES ]

00:01:13.003 --> 00:01:15.309
Mad-Eye:
HEAD FOR THE BURROWS.

00:01:15.353 --> 00:01:17.050
WE'LL RENDEZVOUS THERE.

00:01:17.094 --> 00:01:19.661
ON THE COUNT OF THREE!

00:01:19.705 --> 00:01:21.663
HOLD TIGHT, HARRY![ ENGINE TURNS OVER ]

00:01:21.707 --> 00:01:23.535
ONE...

00:01:23.578 --> 00:01:27.060
TWO...

00:01:27.104 --> 00:01:29.976
[ ENGINE REVS ]

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:31.717
[ THESTRAL SNORTS ]

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:33.719
...THREE!

00:01:36.635 --> 00:01:39.029
[ TIRES SCREECH ]

00:01:53.869 --> 00:01:56.524
[ WIND HOWLING ]

00:01:56.568 --> 00:02:00.224
[ THUNDER RUMBLING ]

00:02:02.966 --> 00:02:04.576
[ THUNDER CRASHES ]

00:02:04.619 --> 00:02:07.579
Death Eater #1: FOLLOW US!Death Eater #2:
WHERE ARE YOU?

00:02:07.622 --> 00:02:10.625
HE'S ON YOUR RIGHT!

00:02:10.669 --> 00:02:12.279
OVER THERE, NOW!

00:02:14.673 --> 00:02:16.022
[ GRUNTS ]

00:02:16.066 --> 00:02:17.806
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:21.332
HAGRID, WE HAVE TO HELP
THE OTHERS!

00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:23.029
I CAN'T DO THAT, HARRY!

00:02:23.073 --> 00:02:24.552
MAD-EYE'S ORDERS!

00:02:30.428 --> 00:02:33.300
HANG ON!
[ GRUNTS ]

00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:38.305
STUPEFY!

00:02:38.349 --> 00:02:39.611
[ GRUNTS ]

00:02:39.654 --> 00:02:41.482
[ TIRES SQUEALING ]

00:02:45.704 --> 00:02:47.880
[ HORNS BLARING ]

00:02:52.798 --> 00:02:54.060
HANG ON, HARRY!

00:02:54.104 --> 00:02:55.409
[ TIRES SQUEAL ]

00:02:55.453 --> 00:02:57.977
[ GRUNTING
AND BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:03:03.809 --> 00:03:05.767
HAGRID!
[ GRUNTING ]

00:03:16.909 --> 00:03:18.519
[ HEDWIG SCREECHES ]

00:03:22.132 --> 00:03:25.265
[ HEDWIG SCREECHES ]NO! NO!

00:03:25.309 --> 00:03:27.659
[ GASPING ]

00:03:35.841 --> 00:03:37.451
AAAH!

00:03:37.495 --> 00:03:39.453
[ GROANING ]

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:49.333
VOLDEMORT: Harry...

00:03:58.168 --> 00:03:59.473
[ SIGHS ]

00:04:06.219 --> 00:04:08.003
[ WOOD CRACKING ]

00:04:12.704 --> 00:04:14.184
[ GRUNTS ]

00:04:15.315 --> 00:04:17.622
AAAAH!

00:04:25.456 --> 00:04:27.719
[ ENGINE SPUTTERING ]

00:04:35.901 --> 00:04:38.686
[ WARBLE ]

00:04:43.735 --> 00:04:45.345
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:04:50.176 --> 00:04:53.092
[ GRUNTING ]

